{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8001_p", "source_sha256": "09b7a9c1e841cf6bebe4fd7f1830b6d49692252a5c2c1e56d8eed8e56b596d56", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画。\nあずささんのテーマは『熟練のバーテンダー』だ）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划。梓小姐的主题是“经验丰富的调酒师”。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8002_010azu", "source_sha256": "e636a8791b4272b90047fbbdbe52b9204fac705971e9301340494a94143638ed", "ja": "こんなに素敵な衣装で撮影できるなんて、嬉しいです♪\n今日もいっぱい頑張っちゃいますね。", "zh": "能穿着这么棒的服装拍摄，我真的很开心♪\n今天也会努力加油的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8003_010azu", "source_sha256": "6b52923442fabc6bd62831d76870bd1ddb133125708832b57f1c1c100e2b184a", "ja": "でも……どうやったら、熟練した感じが出せるでしょう\nか？　練習はしてきましたけど、ちょっと心配で……。", "zh": "可是……要怎么做才能表现出那种熟练的感觉呢？虽然我已经练习过了，但还是有点担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8004_p", "source_sha256": "833440aa6aea7665c9299da3e2067c7e9d7acb246baac7671c53c1b65912c914", "ja": "そうですね……。\n例えば、こんなことを意識したらどうでしょうか？", "zh": "嗯……是啊。比如说，要不要试着注意一下这些方面呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8005", "source_sha256": "01a984e4c892e519a5d08e4899d503e6e49bedef8302e1e399501052417710c6", "ja": "セクシーに", "zh": "性感地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8006", "source_sha256": "9b1b21d1ffc7dcae7a3d05f48f6a4811b3b668235ec5b0ce2a8d828f5223c82e", "ja": "キュートに", "zh": "可爱地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8007", "source_sha256": "509acd77ba9c0ccfc2cadd01f341e1da28a6b7d9319cfb458278b3f691449912", "ja": "クールに", "zh": "酷炫地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8100_p", "source_sha256": "716a7649974f06106f626e3b3808cd118e6e7fe6295df2f294fa5fe98c5a4991", "ja": "バーといえば大人の世界ですから。あずささんの\nセクシーさで、大人の雰囲気をみせてみませんか？", "zh": "说到酒吧，那可是大人的世界嘛。梓小姐的\n性感，要不要用来展现一下大人的氛围呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8102_010azu", "source_sha256": "e64bcf3d57349ca72a3e925071b4558ad4e1dabb0aae4957a1b1e74ac8addd77", "ja": "大人の雰囲気……。なるほど～。\nでは、大人っぽくセクシーな感じで……。", "zh": "成熟大人的氛围……这样啊～。\n那我就试着用成熟性感的风格……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8103_010azu", "source_sha256": "15b2246253b5fa6e3ce0c2d473872a86ea46a145d0d7b9352635cfcef83b1a56", "ja": "「……いらっしゃい。いつもの出すわね」なんて。\nなんだか出来そうな気がしてきました。うふふっ♪", "zh": "“……欢迎光临。还是老样子，对吧。”之类的。\n总觉得好像能做到了。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8200_p", "source_sha256": "5f3a4f05d9efc54e1ab06deb3858ad98be8ec8f8dcc4c04d43de4d333e783ff3", "ja": "ここは意外性を狙ってもいいと思うんです。\nとびきりキュートなバーテンダーとか、どうですか？", "zh": "我觉得这里可以尝试一下出人意料的风格。\n比如，超级可爱的调酒师，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8201_010azu", "source_sha256": "eca42e27802ae4de9f3df5c563a1b52f837377398d9167d3af5230676a2d156b", "ja": "き、キュートですか？　できるかしら……。\n難しそうですけど、やってみますね！", "zh": "可、可爱吗？我能做到吗……  \n虽然感觉有点难，但我会试试的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8202_010azu", "source_sha256": "b4eb82b18c1dbbf14f227e45c4f4bfc653b6d1be3fefe0b10960e9490706dece", "ja": "「いらっしゃいませっ、ご主人様♪　きゅるるんっ♪」\nお、お酒もないのに、顔が赤くなってしまいます～。", "zh": "“欢迎光临，主人♪　啾噜噜♪”\n明明连酒都没有喝，脸却都红起来了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8300_p", "source_sha256": "16b0b449f50187700b6569d5e4758fc281ad806de4ff31f27cc691bdbe564664", "ja": "静かにお酒を楽しむ場所ですからね。人生の酸いも甘い\nも噛み分けた、大人のクールさとかどうでしょう？", "zh": "毕竟这里是安静品酒的地方嘛。要不要展现出那种历经人生酸甜苦辣的大人般的冷静呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8301_010azu", "source_sha256": "f2ff72b60b28efd1e3dae5f14bae90d1d81e752e6ea9c647cb612808df5dcd93", "ja": "それは……えっと、人生経験が豊富な感じをみせる\nってことで合ってますか？　それでしたら……。", "zh": "那个……呃，意思是要表现出阅历丰富的感觉，对吗？如果是这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_8302_010azu", "source_sha256": "a42c6dfbd685ef75cf5e60297203155fe5ed55d62a0375ab6a3afee3976baf4d", "ja": "「坊や、また来たの？　アンタも好きねぇ……フッ」\nど、どうですか？　少しわざとらしかったかしら？", "zh": "“小伙子，又来啦？你还真是喜欢呢……呵。”\n怎、怎么样？是不是有点太刻意了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
